    }
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l01",
      "at": 0.3,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g01",
      "text": "Seven days. Anaya went back to the shop before the sun was high."
    },
    {
      "id": "l02",
      "at": 5.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g01",
      "text": "The other buyer was coming at six o'clock."
    },
    {
      "id": "l03",
      "at": 9.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g02",
      "text": "So she decided she would be there first."
    },
    {
      "id": "l04",
      "at": 12.4,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g03",
      "text": "She sat on the step while the lane got hot and quiet."
    },
    {
      "id": "l05",
      "at": 17.4,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g04",
      "text": "She turned her last coin over and over."
    },
    {
      "id": "l06",
      "at": 21.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g05",
      "text": "The shadows got longer."
    },
    {
      "id": "l07",
      "at": 23.6,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g06",
      "text": "Twice she stood up because she heard someone coming. Twice it was nobody."
    },
    {
      "id": "l08",
      "at": 30.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g07",
      "text": "The shop lights came on."
    },
    {
      "id": "l09",
      "at": 32.6,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g08",
      "text": "Ten to six. Five to six."
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "at": 36.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g09",
      "text": "Six o'clock."
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "at": 38.2,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g09",
      "text": "And nobody came."
    },
    {
      "id": "l12",
      "at": 40.8,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g09",
      "text": "She had waited eight hours, and she had won."
    },
    {
      "id": "l13",
      "at": 45.4,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g10",
      "text": "Then she heard footsteps behind her."
    },
    {
      "id": "l14",
      "at": 48.6,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "g10",
      "text": "Somebody was walking up the lane."
    }
  ]
}
